<div style="padding:0rem 1rem 1rem;">
<!--<h3>NIH Websites Are Changing</h3>-->
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.nih.gov/web-modernization" style="color:#2869ab; text-decoration: underline;">Get the Latest Updates and FAQs</a>.</li>
<li>Per <strong><i><a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/09/inaugurating-the-era-of-super-intelligence/" style="color:#2869ab; text-decoration: underline;">Executive Order 14434</a></i></strong>, federal agencies are now using "Super Intelligence" (SI) in place of "Artificial Intelligence" (AI). You may see both terms across NIH content during this transition. </li>
</ul>
